  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beyond short-term. Lasting skills and effective protection for refugees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A more protective environment for refugees through greater recognition of their economic value, more and better employment, and realistic protection programs.

Synaps will create a more protective environment for refugees through greater recognition of their economic value, more and better employment, and realistic protection programs. The project aims to help vulnerable communities - including refugees, Lebanese, and Jordanians - to take the lead in pushing for change in the protection and livelihoods sectors. Synaps&#x2019; advocacy strategy will target both societal and state actors to improve access to jobs and protection. Finally, Synaps will work with national and sub-national institutions to increase their capabilities in protection of refugees and vulnerable Lebanese and Jordanians through capacity strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
